        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p>
    If you are still unsure after running this test honestly, a session inside
    <a href="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/">career guidance</a>
    can help you compare both paths against your specific situation with an actual person, instead of
    guessing alone from salary screenshots and family opinions.
  </p>

  <h2 id="who-fits-finance">Who genuinely fits finance roles</h2>

  <div class="feature-grid">
